Claude Switcher
Copyright 2026 ElsiKora
A native macOS app for switching the Claude desktop app between accounts.
Unofficial. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

Claude Switcher is a Swift rewrite of Claude Account Switcher. The file
layout it relies on, the switch and auto-switch rules, and the chat and
project import follow that project; the code, the interface and the app
packaging are new.

